{"summary":"跨线列车之间存在时间差，柯南调查一名嫌疑人与另一列车受害者之间看似不可能的移动和毒杀。","sources":["src-detective-conan-world-train-trick-case"],"relatedEpisodes":["episode-0055"],"culprit":{"zhHans":"伊达隆（Takashi Date）。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"motive":{"zhHans":"受害者内海掌握伊达收受药企回扣的证据并以此勒索；伊达不想继续被勒索，因此决定杀死内海。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"method":{"zhHans":"伊达在水之川站下车后戴上假胡子和帽子、翻转外套伪装，再换乘受害者所在的列车；通过电话谎称遗失物品拖延列车，接近内海后用注射器注入诱发心脏病的药物，并抢走硬币伪装成随机抢劫。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"evidence":{"zhHans":"硬币原本由列车女服务员找零给内海，若硬币上出现女服务员指纹，就能证明硬币曾随内海转移到另一列车并证明伊达在案发列车上；假装借款和抢劫动机也无法解释这一指纹证据。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"resolution":{"zhHans":"柯南揭示跨线换车、伪装、拖延列车和硬币指纹证据，伊达在证据链面前崩溃并认罪。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"deepSpoilers":true,"detailStatus":"deepSpoilers","updatedAt":"2026-10-27","dcwPage":"The_Train_Trick_Murder_Case","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Kogoro Mouri","Ran Mouri"],"solvedBy":"Kogoro Mouri (via Conan)","dcwAirDate":"April 21, 1997","dcwFillerCaseNumber":"#20","locations":["Mizunokawa Line"],"locationsSource":"The_Train_Trick_Murder_Case","locationsZh":["水野川线"]}